WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 8.3 · Marketing & Communications
Messaging framework

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Say the same essential things everywhere, adapted to each audience and backed by evidence.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Write a core message in one or two sentences.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Back each supporting message with a proof point.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Test your messages with real people from each audience.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Imara Girls in Science (Registered nonprofit · delivering, Kenya)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“A free science club where your daughter does experiments every week, with women scientists as mentors.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write a core message, proof points and audience versions.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
